                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "237365978",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197987565903",
                            "num_reviews": 349,
                            "playtime_forever": 737,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 737,
                            "last_played": 1791576439
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A classic hidden object game with colorful graphics, mini games (logic puzzles) and, as expected, a somewhat mediocre story.\n\nThe hidden object puzzles themselves can be quite challenging but they are good fun if you have the patience.\n\nI liked the setup with the case board and the notebook keeping track of all story related events and hints.\n\nIt's a fairly long game, especially when playing on expert and you don't skip any puzzles. Some of the hidden object puzzles were bloody hard.\n\nThe game includes a map, but for some reason there's no quick travel. It's not that large of a world, but would have liked to have a faster method of travel since you'll need to go back and forth a lot.\n\nFor achievement hunters: in order to get [i]'One of a kind'[/i], you do have to get ALL others in the same run. Focus on the [i]'Eagle-eyed'[/i] achievement right from the start. This is the hardest.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1791635173,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1791635173,
